===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{senseid|en|optical disc}} {{lb|en|countable}} {{init of|en|[[digital]] [[video]]/[[versatile]] [[disc]]|dot=;}} an [[optical disc]] on which video is recorded in [[digital]] format, such as commercially-released [[movies]] and other video media.
#* {{quote-journal|en-GB|author=J. Oliver Conroy|quotee=Christina|title=The film fans who refuse to surrender to streaming: ‘One day you’ll barter bread for our DVDs’|work=The Guardian|date=2024-03-27|url=https://www.theguardian.com/film/2024/mar/27/the-film-fans-who-refuse-to-surrender-to-streaming-one-day-youll-barter-bread-for-our-dvds|issn=0261-3077|passage=“We’ve lived it. We’ll never give up our collection. Ever. And maybe, one day, you’ll be the one to come and barter a loaf of bread for our '''DVD''' of ''Casino''.”}}
# {{lb|en|uncountable|medicine}} {{init of|en|[[dissociated]] [[vertical]] [[deviation]]}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1999| title=Clinical Strabismus Management|author=Arthur L. Rosenbaum; Alvina Pauline Santiago | page=68| passage=However, if postoperative anatomic intorsion is present, the patient may have '''DVD''' that was incorrectly diagnosed as IOOA and treated by IO muscle recessions. }}

